ieziony do szpitala\" - podała płońska policja w komunikacie.</p><p part=\"Paragraph TextBox\" data-paragraph=\"\">Policjanci badają okoliczności i przebieg tego tragicznego zdarzenia. </p><div part=\"Source TextBox\"><p>Źródło: tvnwarszawa.pl</p><p>Autorka/Autor: pop</p></div></main></div></div><template data-template=\"ERROR_BOARD\"><div class=\"sc-cCAuRXy sc-gYstsuy cKIhnLy jHsovRy sc-134dw4h-0 dvjxtPy NuviBoard\" part=\"NuviBoard\"><div class=\"sc-jgtTJdy foSWooy\"><h1 class=\"sc-aXZVgy sc-gEvEery ldavXXy dUmtgUy sc-eyvILCy sc-gfoqjTy ikDiMZy gEdWdoy NuviBoard-title Title TextBox\" part=\"Title TextBox\"></h1><p class=\"sc-aXZVgy sc-gEvEery ldavXXy dUmtgUy sc-cmQiKEy bpbHbjy NuviBoard-description TextBox\" part=\"TextBox\"></p><p class=\"sc-aXZVgy sc-gEvEery ldavXXy dUmtgUy sc-iRqkffy gdtKODy NuviBoard-support TextBox\" part=\"TextBox\"><a class=\"sc-bXMzgGy cbZsYJy NuviBoard-link\" href=\"\"></a></p></div></div></template><template data-template=\"ERROR_BOARD-audio\"><div data-audio-error-link-href=\"\" data-audio-error-link-text=\"\" data-audio-error-title=\"\"></div></template>\n<!--ESI-SLOT-START(varnish:/_i/y/f/esi/demo)-->\n<!--ESI Generated: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 19:49:20 GMT -->\n<!--ESI-SLOT-END-->\n</div></div>",
